{"seq":2,"slug":"grid","title":"Grid 网格布局","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/modern-css-architecture/layout/grid","wordCount":1078,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"grid-网格布局\">Grid 网格布局</h1><p>整页的&quot;圣杯布局&quot;——顶部通栏、左侧边栏、主内容、右侧栏、底部通栏——在 Grid 出现前是前端面试的经典折磨题，要靠浮动、负边距和精确计算硬拼。今天它是十几行声明的事，而且行列能同时对齐。Grid 是 CSS 唯一的二维布局系统：你先用声明画出一张网格，再把元素摆进格子里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Grid 同时管理行（row）与列（column）两个方向。容器（<code>display: grid</code>）用 <code>grid-template-columns</code>/<code>grid-template-rows</code> 定义轨道（track），用 <code>gap</code> 定义轨道间距；子项则通过 <code>grid-column</code>/<code>grid-row</code> 指定占据哪些网格线之间的区域。没被显式安放的元素，会按&quot;自动放置算法&quot;填进隐式轨道。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[display: grid 容器] --&gt; B[显式网格&lt;br/&gt;grid-template-columns / rows]&#10;  A --&gt; C[轨道间距&lt;br/&gt;gap]&#10;  A --&gt; D[子项放置&lt;br/&gt;grid-column / grid-row / grid-area]&#10;  A --&gt; E[自动放置&lt;br/&gt;grid-auto-flow + 隐式轨道]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[fr 单位&lt;br/&gt;瓜分剩余空间]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[minmax 最小最大]&#10;  B --&gt; B3[repeat + auto-fit/auto-fill&lt;br/&gt;响应式列数]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[网格线编号 / 命名]&#10;  D --&gt; D2[grid-template-areas 命名区域]\">flowchart TD\n  A[display: grid 容器] --&gt; B[显式网格&lt;br/&gt;grid-template-columns / rows]\n  A --&gt; C[轨道间距&lt;br/&gt;gap]\n  A --&gt; D[子项放置&lt;br/&gt;grid-column / grid-row / grid-area]\n  A --&gt; E[自动放置&lt;br/&gt;grid-auto-flow + 隐式轨道]\n  B --&gt; B1[fr 单位&lt;br/&gt;瓜分剩余空间]\n  B --&gt; B2[minmax 最小最大]\n  B --&gt; B3[repeat + auto-fit/auto-fill&lt;br/&gt;响应式列数]\n  D --&gt; D1[网格线编号 / 命名]\n  D --&gt; D2[grid-template-areas 命名区域]</pre><p>下表对比 Grid 的几种轨道定义方式及其用途。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>写法</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>1fr 1fr 1fr</code></td>\n<td>三列等分剩余空间</td>\n<td>等宽三栏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>200px 1fr</code></td>\n<td>固定侧栏 + 自适应主区</td>\n<td>经典两栏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>repeat(3, 1fr)</code></td>\n<td>重复三列 <code>1fr</code></td>\n<td>简化书写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr))</code></td>\n<td>列数随容器自动增减</td>\n<td>响应式卡片墙</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>minmax(0, 1fr)</code></td>\n<td>可收缩到 0 的弹性列</td>\n<td>防止内容撑破网格</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"fr-单位与剩余空间的分配\">fr 单位与剩余空间的分配</h2><p><code>fr</code>（fraction）是 Grid 专属的弹性单位，代表剩余空间的一份。给定 <code>grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr 1fr</code>，浏览器先扣除固定尺寸轨道与 <code>gap</code>，再把剩余空间按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 : 2 : 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 分成四份，三列各得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{2}{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这与 Flexbox 的 <code>flex-grow</code> 比例分配思路一致，但 Grid 在两个维度上同时这么做。</p>\n<p><code>fr</code> 与 <code>minmax()</code> 组合能避免一个常见塌陷：纯 <code>1fr</code> 的轨道在内容过宽（如长单词、大图）时会被撑破。写成 <code>minmax(0, 1fr)</code> 把最小尺寸钳到 0，轨道就能正常收缩并触发内容溢出处理，而不是撑破整个网格。这是生产环境里 Grid 列定义的稳妥写法。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".layout {&#10;  display: grid;&#10;  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 2fr);&#10;  gap: 1.5rem;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.layout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  display</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">grid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  grid-template-columns</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">minmax</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">minmax</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  gap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"auto-fit-auto-fill-与无媒体查询的响应式\">auto-fit、auto-fill 与无媒体查询的响应式</h2><p><code>repeat()</code> 配合 <code>auto-fit</code>/<code>auto-fill</code> 关键字，能让列数随容器宽度自动变化，做出不写一句媒体查询的响应式卡片墙：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".cards {&#10;  display: grid;&#10;  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));&#10;  gap: 1rem;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.cards</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  display</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">grid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  grid-template-columns</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">repeat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">auto-fit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">minmax</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">220</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  gap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这行的含义是&quot;每列至少 220px，能塞几列就塞几列，多出的空间由 <code>1fr</code> 均分&quot;。<code>auto-fit</code> 与 <code>auto-fill</code> 的唯一区别在于空轨道处理：内容不足以填满时，<code>auto-fill</code> 会保留空列（已有项不被拉伸），<code>auto-fit</code> 会折叠空列（已有项铺满整行）。想让少量卡片也撑满一行用 <code>auto-fit</code>，想保持网格节奏感用 <code>auto-fill</code>。这种纯 Grid 的自适应是<a href=\"responsive-container\">响应式与容器查询</a>里推崇的&quot;内在响应式&quot;的基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"网格线-命名区域与元素放置\">网格线、命名区域与元素放置</h2><p>放置元素有两种风格。一是按网格线编号：<code>grid-column: 1 / 3</code> 表示从第 1 条列线跨到第 3 条线（占两列），也可用 <code>span</code> 写成 <code>grid-column: span 2</code>。二是用命名区域，可读性更高：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".page {&#10;  display: grid;&#10;  grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr;&#10;  grid-template-areas:&#10;    &#39;header header&#39;&#10;    &#39;sidebar main&#39;&#10;    &#39;footer footer&#39;;&#10;}&#10;.page &gt; header {&#10;  grid-area: header;&#10;}&#10;.page &gt; nav {&#10;  grid-area: sidebar;&#10;}&#10;.page &gt; main {&#10;  grid-area: main;&#10;}&#10;.page &gt; footer {&#10;  grid-area: footer;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.page</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  display</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">grid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  grid-template-columns</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  grid-template-areas</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'header header'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'sidebar main'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'footer footer'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.page</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\"> header</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  grid-area</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: header;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.page</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\"> nav</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  grid-area</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: sidebar;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.page</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  grid-area</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: main;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.page</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\"> footer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  grid-area</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: footer;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>grid-template-areas</code> 用 ASCII 字符画出布局形状，谁占哪块一目了然，调整布局只需改这几行字符串而不动 HTML。没被显式放置的元素由 <code>grid-auto-flow</code> 控制自动填充方向（默认按行），落入隐式生成的轨道，其尺寸由 <code>grid-auto-rows</code>/<code>grid-auto-columns</code> 决定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"subgrid-让嵌套对齐到外层网格\">subgrid：让嵌套对齐到外层网格</h2><p>Grid 一直有个痛点：子项内部如果也是网格，它的轨道无法与外层网格对齐，导致卡片里的标题、正文、按钮在不同卡片间高低参差。subgrid 解决了这个问题——子网格用 <code>grid-template-rows: subgrid</code> 或 <code>grid-template-columns: subgrid</code> 继承外层对应方向的轨道线，于是所有卡片的内部元素都对齐到同一组网格线。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".cards {&#10;  display: grid;&#10;  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);&#10;  gap: 1rem;&#10;}&#10;.card {&#10;  display: grid;&#10;  grid-row: span 3;&#10;  grid-template-rows: subgrid;&#10;}&#10;/* 三张卡的标题、正文、按钮各自横向对齐 */\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.cards</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  display</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">grid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  grid-template-columns</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">repeat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  gap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.card</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  display</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">grid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  grid-row</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: span </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  grid-template-rows</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">subgrid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 三张卡的标题、正文、按钮各自横向对齐 */</span></span></code></pre></div><p>subgrid 在 2026 年已是 Baseline 可用（Firefox 早在 2019 即支持，Chrome 与 Safari 也已跟进），是构建对齐严格的卡片网格、表单栅格的关键能力。它把 Grid 从&quot;容器级对齐&quot;扩展到了&quot;跨嵌套层级对齐&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Grid 是 CSS 唯一的二维布局系统，行列同时管理；容器定义轨道、子项指定占据区域、未放置者由自动放置算法填充。</li>\n<li><code>fr</code> 按比例分配剩余空间；生产中列定义用 <code>minmax(0, 1fr)</code> 防止内容撑破网格。</li>\n<li><code>repeat(auto-fit/auto-fill, minmax(...))</code> 实现无媒体查询的响应式列数；<code>auto-fit</code> 折叠空列、<code>auto-fill</code> 保留空列。</li>\n<li>元素放置可用网格线编号/<code>span</code>，也可用 <code>grid-template-areas</code> 命名区域，后者可读性与可维护性更好。</li>\n<li>subgrid 让嵌套网格继承外层轨道线，实现跨卡片的内部对齐，2026 已 Baseline 可用。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Grid 网格布局","id":"grid-网格布局"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"fr 单位与剩余空间的分配","id":"fr-单位与剩余空间的分配"},{"level":2,"text":"auto-fit、auto-fill 与无媒体查询的响应式","id":"auto-fit-auto-fill-与无媒体查询的响应式"},{"level":2,"text":"网格线、命名区域与元素放置","id":"网格线-命名区域与元素放置"},{"level":2,"text":"subgrid：让嵌套对齐到外层网格","id":"subgrid-让嵌套对齐到外层网格"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Flexbox 弹性布局","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/modern-css-architecture/layout/flexbox"},"next":{"title":"响应式与容器查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/modern-css-architecture/layout/responsive-container"}}